
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us | Habitat</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/about.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include("navbar.ejs") %>

    <main class="about-page">

        
        <section class="about-hero">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span class="eyebrow">GET TO KNOW US</span>

                <h1>Every journey deserves a <span>beautiful place.</span></h1>

                <p>
                    At Habitat, we help you discover extraordinary places
                    to stay, unforgettable destinations, and spaces that
                    feel just like home.
                </p>

                <a href="/listings" class="primary-btn">
                    Explore Properties <span>↗</span>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-image">
                <img
                    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613490493576-7fde63acd811"
                    alt="Beautiful modern holiday villa"
                >
                <div class="image-caption">
                    <span class="caption-dot"></span>
                    Find your next happy place
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        
        <section class="intro-section">
            <div class="section-label">01 — OUR STORY</div>

            <div class="intro-content">
                <h2>More than a stay.<br><span>A feeling of belonging.</span></h2>

                <p>
                    We believe that the right place can turn an ordinary
                    trip into an extraordinary memory. From peaceful
                    mountain cottages to luxurious beachfront villas,
                    Habitat brings inspiring places together in one
                    convenient platform.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Whether you're planning a weekend escape or your next
                    big adventure, we're here to help you find a place
                    worth remembering.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

       
        <section class="values-section">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <span class="eyebrow">WHAT MAKES US DIFFERENT</span>
                <h2>Designed around <span>your journey.</span></h2>
                <p>Everything you need to discover your next destination.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="values-grid">

                <article class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">⌂</div>
                    <h3>Unique Places</h3>
                    <p>
                        Explore distinctive homes, cozy cottages, and
                        beautiful properties in exciting destinations.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">◎</div>
                    <h3>Easy Discovery</h3>
                    <p>
                        Browse property details, explore locations, and
                        compare prices to find a stay that suits you.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">♡</div>
                    <h3>Made for You</h3>
                    <p>
                        Keep track of the places you love and make
                        planning your next getaway more enjoyable.
                    </p>
                </article>

            </div>
        </section>

        
        <section class="closing-section">
            <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE</span>
                <h2>Somewhere wonderful<br>is waiting for you.</h2>
                <p>Discover your next destination with Habitat.</p>
            </div>

            <a href="/listings" class="closing-btn">
                Find Your Stay <span>↗</span>
            </a>
        </section>

    </main>
    <%- include("footer.ejs") %>

</body>
</html>
